{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"离开亲近的人以后，遇到难事常常只能自己扛，于是开始怀念以前不用防备、有人陪伴、彼此亲近的日子。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"孤单、怀念、失落、害怕失去，最后有一点暖意。\",\n      \"missed\": \"第一段里没有再用受过的气压住想念的细腻转折；「盼着回应却没把握」「隔着玻璃」「母亲轻轻哼歌」「梦里看见远方的家」等具体内容；右上角两条小字也不容易一眼读到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"离开以后，他发现以前有人在身边时，自己面对生活会轻松很多，现在独自承担困难，因而格外想念那种自然亲近的关系。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"孤独、怀旧、渴望、担忧、些许温暖。\",\n      \"missed\": \"「怕以后再也没有了」背后的失去感，以及最后「真真切切过过」带来的安慰；辅助短语中具体画面与抽象情绪的对应关系。下半部分音符和连线较密，视觉上也稍微分散注意力。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"一个离开了亲近关系的人，在独自面对难事时重新意识到过去有人陪伴的珍贵，既想重新拥有那种亲近，又在回忆中获得一点安慰。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"思念、孤独、遗憾、害怕失去、温暖。\",\n      \"missed\": \"「受过的气」与「不再压住想念」之间的心理变化；「不用解释难过」「不必维持坚强」「愿望、委屈」等更细的情绪层次，以及右上角的小标题。下半部分动画变得稀疏，文字相对更容易成为注意中心，但短语仍需要逐个读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"大字正文有四块，且多为较长的整句，字号和视觉权重又比较接近，第一眼不容易确定最应该抓哪一句；辅助短语两行数量较多，既有情绪词又有具体画面，部分内容与「离开后独自承担困难、怀念过去的亲近」之间的联系不够直接。整体故事其实是连贯的，能够抓到孤独、思念和一点暖意，但要完整理解情绪如何从难受、想念走向自我安慰，仍然需要逐句阅读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "008964b8-b61c-4e24-a613-58608af37fe8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004255049044Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:43:53.105067+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6d7f55b43edc02d646c386a78cd3d904852bda333327ab9ca9121004063e8c83", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004255049044Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "92df1c0db628bd76b9c41ff688ca3049f2d8d3621d688bcc722965c50312ef6b"}}}
